Take $a_\alpha = \sqrt{c((2C_+)^2\alpha)/8}$, then for every $a \in (0,a_\alpha)$ and for every $C_- r \leq x \leq C_+ r$ we have $\RR \leq \frac{x}{2}$ hence $C_- r/2 \leq x/2 \leq x-\RR \leq C_+ r$, thus 
